Copyright Fariz Wakan

This package implements Caliper Analytics 1.2 events, a sensor that sends them to an endpoint and the endpoint that receives
them, and reads Caliper Analytics 1.1. It includes no file of 1EdTech: the JSON-LD context that its tests read is downloaded at
a pinned hash and never committed.

The name-based UUIDs of its identifiers follow RFC 9562 and come from the uuid package (MIT).

